L537: |---|---|
L538: |<br>M. gluteus<br>maximus, medius,<br>M. quadriceps<br>femoris *<br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>M. biceps femoris,<br>M.<br>semitendinosus,<br>M.<br>semimebranosus,<br>M. gastrocnemius|<br>**A1: Goblet Box Squat **<br>_Starting position: sitting on the box with the kettlebell holding chest high; feet are positioned_<br>_shoulder width, positioned forward/slightly outward_<br>`o` <br>Move with a straight upper body upwards; knees should not move inside; try to<br>exhale while moving up<br>`o` <br>Move down again; meanwhile try to inhale; touch slightly the box with the<br>buttock and repeat the movement<br> <br> <br> <br> <br>**A2: Leg Curl**<br>_Starting position: sitting on the machine, legs extended to an angle which still feels comfortable;_<br>_the hands are holding the handles on the side_<br>`o` <br>Pressing the machine with the legs down to an angle of about 90° or more; then<br>going back up again in a controlled way; exhale while moving down, inhale<br>while going up<br> <br> <br>|
L539: |Upper body|Col2|
L540: |---|---|
L541: |<br>M. triceps brachii,<br>M. deltoideus<br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>M. latissimus<br>dorsi, M. teres<br>major, M. biceps<br>brachii, M.<br>brachialis<br>|<br>**B1: Dumbbell shoulder press**<br>_Starting position: sitting with a straight upper body on a bench; upper arms are in prolonged_<br>_position to the shoulders, while the hands are holding the dumbbells on head height_<br>`o` <br>Press the dumbbells up until the elbows are extended<br>`o` <br>Return to the starting position<br>`o` <br>Exhale while pressing the weight up; inhale when moving down<br> <br> <br> <br> <br>**B2: Latissimus pull**<br>_Starting position: sitting on the bench; thighs are press against the pad; arms are in extended_<br>_position and hands are holding the bar_<br>`o` <br>Pull the weight down until the bar reaches collarbone<br>`o` <br>Let the weight move back up again in a controlled way<br>`o` <br>Exhale while pulling the weight down; inhale when moving back up<br> <br> <br> <br>|
L542: |Lower body|Col2|
L543: |---|---|
L544: |<br>M. quadriceps<br>femoris|<br>**C1: Leg Press **<br>_Starting position: sitting on the chair of the machine, lower back touching the back of the chair; feet_<br>_are positioned about shoulder width on the plate, toes looking up or slightly outwards; knees are_<br>_bend as far as a comfortable condition is given; hands are holding the handles on the side_<br>`o` <br>Pressing the plate forward until the knees are almost stretched, but not to a full<br>extent<br>`o` <br>Return to the starting position<br>`o` <br>Exhale while pushing the weight forward; inhale while moving the weight back<br> <br> <br> <br> <br>|
