L546: |---|---|
L547: |<br>M. erector spinae,<br>M. gluteus<br>maximus|<br>**C2: Front Plank with alternating leg raise**<br>_Starting position: forearm braced on the bench, while the upper and lower body build a straight_<br>_line, with the toes touching the ground; neck is in a neutral position_<br>`o` <br>Legs get raised in an alternating sequence and hold shortly in the air<br>`o` <br>Intensity can be increased by lowering the position (bench to ground)<br>`o` <br>If using the forearms is too heavy, just the hands can be braced and a push up<br>position can be taken in<br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>|
