L550: |<br>M. latissimus<br>dorsi, M. teres<br>major, M.<br>rhomboideus<br>major, M.<br>deltoideus<br>posterior, M.<br>brachioradialis<br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br> <br>M. pectoralis<br>major, M. triceps<br>brachii, M.<br>deltoideus anterior|<br>**D1: Rowing**<br>_Starting position: sitting with a straight back on the bench; sternum touching the pad; elbows are_<br>_extended and hands are holding the handles_<br>`o` <br>Pull the weights to your body until the handles are reaching the chest<br>`o` <br>Move the weight controlled back to the starting position<br>`o` <br>Exhale while pulling the weight to your body; inhale while moving the weight back<br> <br> <br> <br> <br>**D2: Chest Press**<br>_Starting position: sitting on the bench with the back straight; elbows are bend and hands holding the_<br>_bar in neutral position_<br>`o` <br>Press the weight forward until the elbows are almost extended<br>`o` <br>Let the weight slightly move back<br>`o` <br>Exhale while pushing the weight forward; inhale while moving the weight in the<br>starting position<br> <br> <br> <br> <br>|
